o ensure its sustainable growth and that of its customers. Listed on Euronext, Lectra reported revenues of €507 million in 2025, including €89 million in SaaS revenues. ",{"type":"i","children":["For more information, visit "]},{"type":"i","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=BycCphxjPgY0OrCdVQgOnmeve1ZEyMQVNVP5Z6XS2nhjVXtb1CG1hnxfTvfV4MvzJ4940f20vqRjYPY5rDQgwg==","linkText":"lectra.com"}}]},{"type":"i","children":["."]}]},{"type":"p","children":["Lectra – Registered address: 16–18, rue Chalgrin • 75016 Paris • France"]},{"type":"p","children":["Tel. +33 (0)1 53 64 42 00 – lectra.com"]},{"type":"p","children":["A French ",{"type":"i","children":["Société Anonyme"]}," with share capital of €38,063,263. RCS Paris 300 702 305"]},{"type":"p","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Attachment"]}]},{"type":"list","children":[{"type":"*","children":[{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=O_hSDGjmkX1FSOePAtHkOxfvPj722dd5TAYKtb296DvlFh4ci4E_oTyJ72yxREWHds73fvf5XDiMaaSEYRe0T5lArkV8rinoCsJhJXCbDUNScM8c9wezBNFRNlGZseUukACFovLvLvlmdL7v3hm7GiqK5Ve2BO-322CLbWjzIZIRFgEowwQUdLzg0dOEjFtiE8QXFyhPwosp-QAbZb4oKzYtIqIVfK7M3ckVa62FtjuRjGMdTxUxAA2b97B70h70aWRR5pvb-ZrcTxZGYckngyeiLlw8x5ULN6YB2QpWkjY7IMJMNu8cEmN00mb6EISlKZrq5nM9f8sYW_TYPfafTg==","linkText":"LECTRA: Share buyback program - Aggregated disclosure of transactions in own shares carried out from September 14 to September 18, 2026"}}]}]}]},"language":"en","tags":[{"title":"French stocks","args":[{"id":"category","value":"stock"},{"id":"market_country","value":"FR"}]},{"title":"GlobeNewswire","args":[{"id":"provider","value":"globenewswire"}]},{"title":"Share buybacks","args":[{"id":"section","value":"share_buybacks"}]}],"robots":["noindex"],"id":"globenewswire:fb8e50e25094b:0","title":"LECTRA: Share buyback program - Aggregated disclosure of transactions in own shares carried out from September 14 to September 18, 2026","published":1790006400,"urgency"